  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In the latest VRChat update 2025.2.2, the avatar menu has been redesigned and displays the author of an Avatar below the thumbnail. \n\nWhile this is a nice feature, it generally takes up quite a bit of space, especially in the submenus \"Uploaded\" and \"SDK Test Avatars\", where only your own name appears under the avatars.\n\nFor this reason, it would be nice if there were an option to hide the avatar author below the thumbnail, like how it was before the update.\n\nMaybe something like a checkbox next to the \"Sorted by\" option where you could turn the whole thing on and off dynamically",
